  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOZ009N Mozambique ACJR 2026 - Implementation Level</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CARE, together with its local partner AMA, is delivering an integrated WASH, multipurpose cash assistance (MPCA) and protection response to flood-affected households in Gaza Province.
The project prioritises rapid rehabilitation of damaged water points and distribution of WASH kits aligned with WASH Cluster standards to restore safe water access and hygiene.
MPCA is provided in parallel through mobile money where feasible, enabling households to meet urgent basic needs with dignity and reduce negative coping strategies.
Community-based GBV awareness activities complement sectoral assistance, while protection mainstreaming and Accountability to Affected Populations are integrated throughout.</narrative>
  </description>
